# The blocker's Android half is source and belongs in the repository: ten Java
# files, a manifest that declares an accessibility service and a device admin,
# the strings Android shows on the permission dialogs, and the JVM tests that
# cover the rules. None of it was tracked until 2026-10-13 — the root
# .gitignore said `android/`, and a pattern with a trailing slash and no
# leading one matches a directory of that name at *any* depth, so it quietly
# took this one with it.
#
# What stays out is what Gradle writes.
/build/
/.gradle/
local.properties
*.iml
.idea/
captures/
